This repository contains material derived from evand/square-packing
(https://github.com/evand/square-packing, commit 7d6f46d9d0780241245dfbf77bad28aa1594c6b5):

  s12_lower_3.969118.txt is Evan Daniel's certificate s12/certificates/s12_lower_3.9686.txt
  with every coordinate and the container side multiplied by 7902/7901; the files in
  controls/ are rescalings of Daniel's certificates used as test cases.

